{
  "_comment": "Pins envelope-level rejections inside an OPEN session. Message 2 carries an unsupported macp_version; message 3 names an unknown session; message 4 names a mode other than the one this session is bound to. None of them changes this session: both voters can still vote afterwards, and the final mode state records exactly those two votes.",
  "description": "Core envelope handling: unsupported in-session macp_version, an unknown session_id and a mismatched mode are rejected without side effects.",
  "mode": "macp.mode.decision.v1",
  "initiator": "agent://orchestrator",
  "participants": [
    "agent://orchestrator",
    "agent://a",
    "agent://b"
  ],
  "mode_version": "1.0.0",
  "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
  "policy_version": "",
  "ttl_ms": 60000,
  "expected_mode_state": {
    "votes": {
      "p1": {
        "agent://a": {
          "vote": "APPROVE"
        },
        "agent://b": {
          "vote": "APPROVE"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "messages": [
    {
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Proposal",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.ProposalPayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "option": "deploy",
        "rationale": "ready",
        "supporting_data": []
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0001 Section 4.1 and Section 7.6 item 1: an in-session envelope carrying an unsupported macp_version is rejected. Otherwise the Vote is valid.",
      "sender": "agent://a",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "r"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "UNSUPPORTED_PROTOCOL_VERSION",
      "envelope": {
        "macp_version": "2.0"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0001 Section 5 (session isolation): an envelope naming a session that does not exist is rejected, and nothing reaches this fixture's session. The session_id is a well-formed lowercase UUID v4 that no session uses.",
      "sender": "agent://b",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "r"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND",
      "envelope": {
        "session_id": "9c2e4b7a-1d3f-4e8a-a5b6-7f0c9d2e1a48"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "RFC-MACP-0001 Section 7.6 item 8: the envelope's mode differs from the mode bound at SessionStart, so it is rejected INVALID_ENVELOPE before any Mode rule runs. Everything else matches the Vote accepted next.",
      "sender": "agent://a",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "r"
      },
      "envelope": {
        "mode": "macp.mode.quorum.v1"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://a",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "r"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://b",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "r"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    }
  ],
  "expected_final_state": "Open"
}
